WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Example ideas only. Where could your arrival zone be safe?

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.400
Include at least 2 obstacles. Choose your own approach and landing site.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.600
One obstacle example: how could you leave room for a safe arrival?

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:20.800
At your chosen landing zone, code land(). Then signal at a relay.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:26.000
Test your approach. Explain how you confirmed a safe touchdown.
